@startuml
title EQUIP MITAMA MAIN - コマンド相互作用図
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
' Source: ScenarioRunner.Engine/Execution/ScenarioCommandExecutor.cs
' Source: ScenarioRunner.Engine/Automation/Operator/Feature/InputOperator.cs
participant "ScenarioCommandExecutor" as EX
participant "InputOperator" as O
participant "ComboBoxOperator" as CO
participant "MainForm" as GUI

EX -> O : Equip(session, arguments)
activate O
O -> O : GuiOperator経由で要素マップを取得
O -> O : equipMain(): 御魂スロット番号とステータス種類を解析
O -> CO : SelectItem(MainStat(slot), statType)
O -> GUI : メインステータスの選択変更イベント
O --> EX : 処理完了（失敗時は例外）
deactivate O
@enduml
